  {
   "id": "matematicas-2014-junio-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) y \\(g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) las funciones definidas respectivamente por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{|x|}2\\) y \\(g(x)=\\dfrac1{1+x^2}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Esboza las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\) sobre los mismos ejes y calcula los puntos de corte entre ambas gráficas.",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f(x)=\\frac{|x|}2\\) son dos semirrectas que salen del origen (pendientes \\(\\pm\\frac12\\)). \\(g\\) es par, positiva, con máximo \\((0,1)\\) y asíntota horizontal \\(y=0\\). Las dos son pares, así que basta buscar los cortes con \\(x\\ge0\\):</p>\\[\\frac x2=\\frac1{1+x^2}\\iff x^3+x-2=0\\iff(x-1)(x^2+x+2)=0\\iff x=1\\]<p>(\\(x^2+x+2\\) no tiene raíces reales.) Por simetría, también \\(x=-1\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 170' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='109.4,98.0 110.7,96.9 112.1,95.8 113.4,94.6 114.8,93.4 116.1,92.1 117.5,90.9 118.9,89.6 120.2,88.2 121.6,86.9 122.9,85.5 124.3,84.1 125.6,82.7 127.0,81.3 128.3,79.9 129.7,78.5 131.0,77.1 132.4,75.8 133.8,74.5 135.1,73.2 136.5,72.0 137.8,70.9 139.2,69.8 140.5,68.9 141.9,68.0 143.2,67.3 144.6,66.6 145.9,66.1 147.3,65.8 148.6,65.6 150.0,65.5 151.4,65.6 152.7,65.8 154.1,66.1 155.4,66.6 156.8,67.3 158.1,68.0 159.5,68.9 160.8,69.8 162.2,70.9 163.5,72.0 164.9,73.2 166.2,74.5 167.6,75.8 169.0,77.1 170.3,78.5 171.7,79.9 173.0,81.3 174.4,82.7 175.7,84.1 177.1,85.5 178.4,86.9 179.8,88.2 181.1,89.6 182.5,90.9 183.9,92.1 185.2,93.4 186.6,94.6 187.9,95.8 189.3,96.9 190.6,98.0 190.6,98.0 189.3,99.1 187.9,100.2 186.6,101.2 185.2,102.3 183.9,103.4 182.5,104.5 181.1,105.6 179.8,106.7 178.4,107.8 177.1,108.8 175.7,109.9 174.4,111.0 173.0,112.1 171.7,113.2 170.3,114.2 169.0,115.3 167.6,116.4 166.2,117.5 164.9,118.6 163.5,119.7 162.2,120.8 160.8,121.8 159.5,122.9 158.1,124.0 156.8,125.1 155.4,126.2 154.1,127.2 152.7,128.3 151.4,129.4 150.0,130.5 148.6,129.4 147.3,128.3 145.9,127.2 144.6,126.2 143.2,125.1 141.9,124.0 140.5,122.9 139.2,121.8 137.8,120.8 136.5,119.7 135.1,118.6 133.8,117.5 132.4,116.4 131.0,115.3 129.7,114.2 128.3,113.2 127.0,112.1 125.6,111.0 124.3,109.9 122.9,108.8 121.6,107.8 120.2,106.7 118.9,105.6 117.5,104.5 116.1,103.4 114.8,102.3 113.4,101.2 112.1,100.2 110.7,99.1 109.4,98.0' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='20.0,124.7 23.3,124.4 26.5,124.2 29.8,123.8 33.0,123.5 36.2,123.1 39.5,122.8 42.8,122.3 46.0,121.9 49.2,121.4 52.5,120.9 55.7,120.3 59.0,119.7 62.2,119.0 65.5,118.3 68.8,117.5 72.0,116.6 75.2,115.7 78.5,114.6 81.8,113.5 85.0,112.2 88.2,110.9 91.5,109.4 94.8,107.7 98.0,105.9 101.2,103.9 104.5,101.7 107.8,99.3 111.0,96.7 114.3,93.9 117.5,90.9 120.7,87.7 124.0,84.4 127.2,81.0 130.5,77.7 133.8,74.5 137.0,71.5 140.2,69.0 143.5,67.1 146.8,65.9 150.0,65.5 153.2,65.9 156.5,67.1 159.8,69.0 163.0,71.5 166.2,74.5 169.5,77.7 172.8,81.0 176.0,84.4 179.2,87.7 182.5,90.9 185.8,93.9 189.0,96.7 192.2,99.3 195.5,101.7 198.8,103.9 202.0,105.9 205.2,107.7 208.5,109.4 211.8,110.9 215.0,112.2 218.3,113.5 221.5,114.6 224.8,115.7 228.0,116.6 231.2,117.5 234.5,118.3 237.8,119.0 241.0,119.7 244.2,120.3 247.5,120.9 250.8,121.4 254.0,121.9 257.2,122.3 260.5,122.8 263.8,123.1 267.0,123.5 270.2,123.8 273.5,124.2 276.8,124.4 280.0,124.7' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,26.5 24.3,30.0 28.7,33.4 33.0,36.9 37.3,40.4 41.7,43.8 46.0,47.3 50.3,50.8 54.7,54.2 59.0,57.7 63.3,61.2 67.7,64.6 72.0,68.1 76.3,71.6 80.7,75.0 85.0,78.5 89.3,82.0 93.7,85.4 98.0,88.9 102.3,92.4 106.7,95.8 111.0,99.3 115.3,102.8 119.7,106.2 124.0,109.7 128.3,113.2 132.7,116.6 137.0,120.1 141.3,123.6 145.7,127.0 150.0,130.5 154.3,127.0 158.7,123.6 163.0,120.1 167.3,116.6 171.7,113.2 176.0,109.7 180.3,106.2 184.7,102.8 189.0,99.3 193.3,95.8 197.7,92.4 202.0,88.9 206.3,85.4 210.7,82.0 215.0,78.5 219.3,75.0 223.7,71.6 228.0,68.1 232.3,64.6 236.7,61.2 241.0,57.7 245.3,54.2 249.7,50.8 254.0,47.3 258.3,43.8 262.7,40.4 267.0,36.9 271.3,33.4 275.7,30.0 280.0,26.5' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='109.4' cy='98.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='51.4' y='94.0'>(−1, 1/2)</text><circle cx='190.6' cy='98.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='196.6' y='94.0'>(1, 1/2)</text><text x='239.4' y='105.8' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='12'>g</text><text x='243.4' y='42.7' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='12'>f</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 130.5H294.0M150.0 164.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='28.1' y1='127.5' x2='28.1' y2='133.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='25.1' y='144.5' font-size='10'>-3</text><line x1='68.8' y1='127.5' x2='68.8' y2='133.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='65.8' y='144.5' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='109.4' y1='127.5' x2='109.4' y2='133.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='106.4' y='144.5' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='190.6' y1='127.5' x2='190.6' y2='133.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='187.6' y='144.5' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='231.2' y1='127.5' x2='231.2' y2='133.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='228.2' y='144.5' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='271.9' y1='127.5' x2='271.9' y2='133.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='268.9' y='144.5' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='147.0' y1='65.5' x2='153.0' y2='65.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='69.5' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Se cortan en \\(\\left(-1,\\frac12\\right)\\) y \\(\\left(1,\\frac12\\right)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Entre \\(-1\\) y \\(1\\), \\(g\\) queda por encima de \\(f\\). Por la simetría, calculo la mitad derecha y la duplico:</p>\\[A=2\\int_0^1\\left(\\frac1{1+x^2}-\\frac x2\\right)dx=2\\Bigl[\\mathrm{arctg}\\,x-\\frac{x^2}4\\Bigr]_0^1=2\\left(\\frac\\pi4-\\frac14\\right)=\\frac{\\pi-1}2\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{\\pi-1}2\\approx1{,}071\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "area",
     "apartados": "a, b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
