  {
   "id": "matematicas-2014-junio-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera la recta \\(r\\) que pasa por los puntos \\(A(1,0,-1)\\) y \\(B(-1,1,0)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Halla la ecuación de la recta \\(s\\) paralela a \\(r\\) que pasa por \\(C(-2,3,2)\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula la distancia de \\(r\\) a \\(s\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) tiene director \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}=(-2,1,1)\\). La recta \\(s\\), paralela a \\(r\\), tiene el mismo director y pasa por \\(C(-2,3,2)\\):</p><div class='res'>\\(s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=-2-2\\lambda\\\\y=3+\\lambda\\\\z=2+\\lambda\\end{cases}\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(A(1,0,-1)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(-2,1,1)\\), y \\(s\\) por \\(C(-2,3,2)\\) con el mismo director.</p><p>La distancia entre dos rectas paralelas es la distancia de un punto de una de ellas a la otra<i class='n' data-t='why'>Entre dos rectas paralelas la distancia es la misma desde cualquier punto de una de ellas.</i>. Calculo \\(d(C,r)\\) proyectando \\(C(-2,\\ 3,\\ 2)\\) sobre \\(r\\).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a </b>\\(r\\)<b> por </b>\\(C\\)<b>:</b> su vector normal es \\(\\vec d=(-2,\\ 1,\\ 1)\\). Es de la forma \\(-2x+y+z+D=0\\) y con \\(C\\): \\(D=-9\\). Queda \\(-2x+y+z-9=0\\).</p><p><b>Paso 2. Corte con </b>\\(r\\) \\((1-2t,\\ t,\\ -1+t)\\):</p>\\[-2(1-2t)+t+(-1+t)-9=0\\iff 6t-12=0\\iff t=2\\Rightarrow M(-3,\\ 2,\\ 1)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Distancia:</b></p>\\[d(r,s)=|\\overrightarrow{CM}|=\\left|(-1,\\ -1,\\ -1)\\right|=\\sqrt{3}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-90,\"el\":42,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-0.2,0.6,-0.4],[-5.4,3.2,2.2],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-5.4,3.2,2.2],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[0.4,1.8,0.8],[-4.8,4.4,3.4],\"#7c3aed\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-4.8,4.4,3.4],\"s\",\"#7c3aed\",6,0],[\"line\",[-2.0,3.0,2.0],[-3.0,2.0,1.0],\"#16a34a\",2.0,true],[\"line\",[-2.856,2.144,1.144],[-3.06,2.246,1.246],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-3.06,2.246,1.246],[-3.204,2.102,1.102],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[-2.0,3.0,2.0],\"C\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-3.0,2.0,1.0],\"M\",-16,12]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m14ja4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m14ja4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m14ja4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m14ja4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='246.9' y1='246.0' x2='26.0' y2='90.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='32.0' y='90.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='272.4' y1='174.0' x2='51.5' y2='18.0' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='57.5' y='18.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='170.4' y1='102.0' x2='128.0' y2='162.0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.0' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='134.1' y1='153.3' x2='125.4' y2='147.2' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='125.4' y1='147.2' x2='119.3' y2='155.9' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='170.4' cy='102.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='177.4' y='96.0' font-weight='700'>C</text><circle cx='128.0' cy='162.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='112.0' y='174.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='40.0' y2='270.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='42.6' y='274.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='259.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='259.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='258.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='257.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(210.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(d(r,s)=\\sqrt{3}\\approx1{,}732\\) unidades</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con la fórmula: \\(\\dfrac{|\\overrightarrow{AC}\\times\\vec d|}{|\\vec d|}=\\sqrt{3}\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "geom",
     "tipo": "ecs",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "geom",
