   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Paso \\(r\\) a paramétricas. Su director es perpendicular a los normales de los dos planos que la definen:</p>\\[\\vec d=(1,2,-1)\\times(2,-1,1)=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&2&-1\\\\2&-1&1\\end{vmatrix}=(1,\\,-3,\\,-5)\\]<p>Un punto de \\(r\\): con \\(z=0\\), \\(x+2y=3\\) y \\(2x-y=1\\Rightarrow x=1,\\ y=1\\): \\(P(1,1,0)\\).</p><p>El plano contiene a \\(\\vec d\\) y a \\(\\overrightarrow{OP}=(1,1,0)\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec d\\times\\overrightarrow{OP}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&-3&-5\\\\1&1&0\\end{vmatrix}=(5,\\,-5,\\,4)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(5x-5y+4z+D=0\\) y pasa por el origen: \\(D=0\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-45,\"el\":28,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-1.12,1.614,3.418],[0.082,-1.995,-2.597],[2.063,-0.442,-3.132],[0.86,3.166,2.882]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[2.063,-0.442,-3.132],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[0.4,2.8,3.0],[1.6,-0.8,-3.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.6,-0.8,-3.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[1.2,0.4,-1.0],[1.369,-0.107,-1.845],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"pt\",[0,0,0],\"O\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,1,0],\"P\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m14jb4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m14jb4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m14jb4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m14jb4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='77.6,18.0 26.0,227.4 101.7,246.0 153.3,36.6' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='105.7' y='246.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='135.6' y1='32.5' x2='84.1' y2='241.4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='90.1' y='241.4' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='101.3' y1='171.8' x2='94.0' y2='201.2' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m14jb4d)'/><text x='98.0' y='197.2' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><circle cx='67.0' cy='137.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='74.0' y='131.0' font-weight='700'>O</text><circle cx='109.9' cy='137.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='116.9' y='131.0' font-weight='700'>P</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='35.3' y2='275.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.3' y='281.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='35.3' y2='264.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.3' y='266.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='254.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(260.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(5x-5y+4z=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con \\(P\\): \\(5-5+0=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
